g for firmware updates in the backgroundâ€¦</div>␀<div class='version-state bad'>Update check failed: ␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state update'>New firmware available: v␀</div><form id='ota-install-form' method='post' action='/ota/install'><button type='submit'␀>Download and install v␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state current'><strong>Firmware is up to date.</strong><br><span class='muted'>Latest available: v␀␀</span></div>␀␀␀<p><a class='btn secondary' href='/ota?refresh=1'>Check again</a></p><p class='muted'>Firmware file: <code>␀</code></p>␀<p class='bad'>Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile. Upload a matching app-only firmware file manually.</p>␀␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Upload compiled file</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has no internet access. Select the matching app-only file such as <code>firmware-app-c3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-s3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-c5.bin</code>, or <code>firmware-app-c6.bin</code>. Do not upload the USB <code>firmware.bin</code> merged image here.</p>␀␀␀␀<form id='ota-upload-form' method='post' action='/ota/upload' enctype='multipart/form-data'>␀␀␀␀<input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin,application/octet-stream' required␀␀><button type='submit'␀␀>Upload and install file</button></form></div>␀␀<script src='/ota.js'></script>␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀Cache-Control␀␀␀no-store␀␀␀␀text/html; charset=utf-8␀␀␀␀refresh␀X-ESP32MIC-OTA-Reboot␀␀␀Firmware uploaded and installed. Device will reboot now.␀␀␀␀Upload failed: ␀forbidden␀␀␀Stop and save recording before updating firmware.␀␀␀Update preparation is in progress. Please wait.␀firmware.bin␀␀␀␀firmware-␀␀␀firmware-app-␀␀␀OTA upload start: ␀␀Update begin failed: ␀␀␀Flash write failed: ␀␀␀␀Update end failed: ␀Update was not fully written.␀␀␀OTA upload installed, bytes=␀␀␀␀Upload aborted.␀/ota/install␀␀␀␀/ota/upload␀/api/ota_status␀Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile.␀/updates/ota-version.txt␀␀␀␀Could not open the fir